 "differences": [
  "The paper says the steering signal was originally sampled at 60 Hz; the simulator logs have a median interval of about 17 ms (58.8 Hz, intervals alternate between 16 and 17 ms) and an average rate of about 60 Hz, so this was not used as a check. sample_rate_hz is the average rate (samples per second of recording).",
  "The paper's correlation and lag results rely on preprocessing (outlier removal, normalisation, saccade removal) not available in the deposit, so only the design numbers (participants, drives, sample rates) are checked.",
